; Error messages
;
MSG_NOPREP ($10//)
The lowest memory of the Amiga is not reserved.\n\
Run ReserveLow from the ShapeShifter drawer\n\
(the Amiga restarts once), then start\n\
ShapeShifter again.
;
MSG_NO68020 (//)
ShapeShifter requires a least\n\
a 68020 processor.
;
MSG_NOMEM (//)
There is not enough memory available\n\
to start ShapeShifter.
;
MSG_NOSCREEN (//)
The Macintosh screen cannot be\n\
created.\n\
Either there is not enough graphics\n\
memory available or the selected\n\
graphics mode is not displayable on\n\
your Amiga.
;
MSG_NOEGS (//)
EGS is not installed\n\
on your Amiga.
;
MSG_NOTRUEAMIGA (//)
Color depths of 15 or 24 bit are not\n\
possible with the 'Amiga bitplanes'\n\
screen type.
;
MSG_NO124VGA (//)
Color depths of 1, 2 or 4 bit are only\n\
possible with the 'Amiga bitplanes'\n\
screen type.
;
MSG_NOROM (//)
The file 'ShapeShifter ROM' is\n\
missing or damaged.\n\
Copy this file into the drawer\n\
ShapeShifter is in.
;
MSG_ROMVERSION (//)
The version number of the\n\
Macintosh ROM is not 124.
;
MSG_NOTIMER (//)
ShapeShifter is unable to find\n\
a free CIA timer.\n\
Quit other programs and then try\n\
again to start ShapeShifter.
;
MSG_SEMATWICE (//)
Please don't try again to\n\
start ShapeShifter. :-)
;
MSG_BADPART (//)
This volume is not usable\n\
as a DeviceDisk.
;
MSG_BADAFD (//)
The FileDisk could not be created.
;
MSG_NOCYBERGFX (//)
The 'cybergraphics.library' is\n\
not installed on your Amiga.
;
MSG_NOCYBERMODE (//)
The selected screen mode is\n\
not a CyberGraphX/Picasso96 mode.
;
MSG_NO16BITMODE (//)
You have selected a 16 bit\n\
graphics mode (65536 colors),\n\
but ShapeShifter requires a\n\
15 bit (32768 colors) mode.
;
MSG_ROMNOTUSABLE (//)
This Macintosh ROM is not usable\n\
with ShapeShifter as something\n\
needed is missing in it.
;
MSG_TRYLARGEST (//)
The amount of memory you specified\n\
for the Macintosh is not available.\n\
Do you want to use the largest free\n\
block instead?
;
MSG_ROMCHECKSUM (//)
The checksum of this Macintosh ROM\n\
is not correct. This could mean that\n\
the ROM is damaged. Do you nevertheless\n\
want to use it?
;
MSG_NOCYBERMEM (//)
There is not enough free FastRAM\n\
for the CyberGraphX/Picasso96 screen.
;
MSG_CANTLOADEVD (//)
The external video driver\n\
could not be loaded.
;
MSG_ISNOEVD (//)
The selected external video\n\
driver is not a ShapeShifter\n\
video driver.
;
MSG_ROMSIZE (//)
The file 'ShapeShifter ROM' has\n\
an incorrect size. It must be\n\
exactly 524288 or 1048576 bytes.
;
MSG_ONLYONEMACBOX (//)
The Amiga Window type cannot be\n\
used with the "2 monitors" setting.
;
MSG_ONLYONEAMIGA (//)
It is not possible to set both\n\
monitors to "Amiga bitplanes".
;
